\[f'(b) = \frac{d}{db} \left( \frac{2}{1 - 2b} + \frac{1}{b} \right) = \frac{d}{db} \left( 2(1 - 2b)^{-1} + b^{-1} \right) = 2(-1)(1 - 2b)^{-2}(-2) + (-1)b^{-2} = \frac{4}{(1 - 2b)^2} - \frac{1}{b^2}.\]
